# rooms. Rows 0 and 11 are walls (row 11's EE the way out); columns 0 and 15 the side walls.
#   #  the wall's top            l  a lift's floor light (over L)
#   =  plain wall   M menu   P poster   w window   s shelves   r mirror   v screen   V the view
#   t  tiles   o wood   L lift   S stairs   A a flat's door   X mailboxes   E the way out   _ wall
#   .  the floor          @ the shopkeeper   * where customers stand (the counter's in front)
#   +  somewhere people go (sit, browse)
#   C T G W counters (T the till; G glass; W white)  b table  q barbecue  n snacks  f fridge
#   k books  h clothes  H hanbok  m medicine  c cosmetics  K cake case  x salon chair  p PC
